<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>New Login Detected</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #2c3e50; background-color: #ecf0f1; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 30px auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
    .header { background: #2c3e50; color: #ffffff; padding: 30px 20px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 3px solid #27ae60; }
    .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
    .content { padding: 40px 35px; }
    .info-box { background: #f8f9fa; border-left: 3px solid #27ae60; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 2px; }
    .info-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0; }
    .info-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .info-label { font-weight: 600; color: #7f8c8d; }
    .info-value { color: #2c3e50; }
    .alert-box { background: #fff8e1; border: 2px solid #ffa000; border-radius: 2px; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; }
    .button { display: inline-block; padding: 12px 28px; background: #e74c3c; color: #ffffff !important; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 3px; margin: 10px 5px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.3px; }
    .button-secondary { background: #95a5a6; }
    .footer { background: #f8f9fa; padding: 25px 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: #7f8c8d; border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0; }
    ul { padding-left: 20px; }
    li { margin: 8px 0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>New Login Detected</h1>
    </div>
    
    <div class="content">
      <p>Dear <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>
      
      <p>We detected a new login to your UniRooms account. If this was you, no further action is required.</p>
      
      <div class="info-box">
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #27ae60; font-size: 16px;">Login Details</h3>
        
        <div class="info-row">
          <span class="info-label">Time:</span>
          <span class="info-value">{{loginTime}}</span>
        </div>
        
        <div class="info-row">
          <span class="info-label">Device:</span>
          <span class="info-value">{{device}}</span>
        </div>
        
        <div class="info-row">
          <span class="info-label">Location:</span>
          <span class="info-value">{{location}}</span>
        </div>
        
        <div class="info-row">
          <span class="info-label">IP Address:</span>
          <span class="info-value">{{ipAddress}}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="alert-box">
        <strong>Security Alert:</strong><br>
        If you did not authorize this login, your account security may be compromised. Please take immediate action to secure your account.
        
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">
          <a href="#" class="button">Secure My Account</a>
          <a href="#" class="button button-secondary">Change Password</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <p><strong>Security Recommendations:</strong></p>
      <ul>
        <li>Never share your password with anyone</li>
        <li>Use a strong, unique password for your account</li>
        <li>Enable two-factor authentication when available</li>
        <li>Be cautious of phishing attempts and suspicious emails</li>
      </ul>
      
      <p>If you have any questions or security concerns, please contact our support team immediately.</p>
      
      <p>Best regards,<br><strong>UniRooms Security Team</strong></p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="footer">
      <p><strong>UniRooms</strong> - Student Accommodation Platform</p>
      <p>© {{year}} UniRooms. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p>This is an automated security notification. Please do not reply to this email.</p>
      <p>Email: security@pgfinder.com</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
